# Synthesizer / sweep rules

See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [agent/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md](agent/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md) §4–5, §11–13.

- `commit_plan()` → write → `mark_written()`; on failure `mark_write_failed()`
- Do not use optimistic `commit()` in the write path
- `_write_stale_registers` (diff-based) vs `_write_prebuilt_plan` (sweep tables)
- Sweeper auto-enables fast-hop (`double_buffer`, 6 ns LDP); do not add `SynthPolicy`
- Duck-typed device: `write_registers`, `chip_enable`, `chip_disable`, `read_muxout`

Tests: `test_synthesizer.py`, `test_sweep.py`.
